---
import EscapeHatch from "../../../components/demos/EscapeHatch.astro";
import DemoSeo from "../../../components/demos/DemoSeo.astro";

// Démo : Atelier Nord · studio automobile haut de gamme, Brossard QC.
// Reconstruit comme un JOURNAL DE BAIE : pas de hero. La page ouvre sur le
// dernier bon de travail estampillé, puis un registre des travaux passés,
// une carte des tarifs épinglée au mur, et un formulaire de dépôt de bon.
// Direction artistique autonome.
const IMG = {
  hero: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503376780353-7e6692767b70?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  garage: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492144534655-ae79c964c9d7?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  detail: "/demos/atelier-nord/01.jpg",
  engine: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486262715619-67b85e0b08d3?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
};
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <DemoSeo demoId="atelier-nord" locale="fr" title="Atelier Nord · Journal de baie · Brossard" description="Journal de baie d'Atelier Nord : de vrais bons de travail, des prix honnêtes et un garage que vous pouvez lire avant de réserver. Brossard, QC." ogImage="https://webao.ca/demos/atelier-nord/01.jpg" />


  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body class="an">

  <!-- Slim shop header: no hero, straight to the log -->
  <header class="an-top">
    <div class="an-wrap an-top-in">
      <a class="an-logo" href="#top" aria-label="Atelier Nord · haut">
        <span class="an-logo-mark" aria-hidden="true">N/</span>
        <span class="an-logo-text">ATELIER&nbsp;NORD</span>
        <span class="an-logo-sub">journal de baie</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="an-links" aria-label="Principale">
        <a href="#latest">Dernier travail</a>
        <a href="#log">Le journal</a>
        <a href="#rates">Carte des tarifs</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="an-btn an-btn-amber an-btn-sm" href="#order">Déposer un bon de travail</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">

    <!-- LATEST JOB: a stamped work order, torn off the pad -->
    <article class="an-wrap an-ticket" id="latest" aria-labelledby="ticket-title">
      <div class="an-ticket-perf" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="an-ticket-body">
        <div class="an-ticket-head">
          <p class="an-mono an-ticket-kicker">Bon de travail n° 2481 · ouvert le 3 oct. 2026</p>
          <p class="an-stamp" aria-label="Travail terminé">Terminé</p>
        </div>
        <h1 class="an-h1" id="ticket-title">Porsche 911 Carrera<span class="an-h1-sub">Polissage 2 étapes + céramique 5 ans</span></h1>
        <dl class="an-ticket-meta">
          <div><dt class="an-mono">Baie</dt><dd>01</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="an-mono">Techniciens</dt><dd>M.L. + J.R.</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="an-mono">Heures</dt><dd>34.5</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="an-mono">Kilométrage</dt><dd>18,204 km</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="an-mono">Total</dt><dd>$3,850</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="an-ticket-note">Décontamination complète de la peinture, polissage machine en deux étapes, documentation photo panneau par panneau, puis une céramique 5 ans. Le propriétaire l'a récupérée samedi et s'est arrêté deux fois sur le chemin du retour pour la regarder. Ça arrive souvent.</p>
        <figure class="an-beforeafter">
          <div class="an-ba">
            <img src={IMG.garage} alt="La 911 à son arrivée, peinture terne sous les néons de l'atelier" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
            <figcaption class="an-mono">Avant · à la réception</figcaption>
          </div>
          <div class="an-ba">
            <img src={IMG.hero} alt="La 911 après le polissage, peinture profonde et réfléchissante" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" />
            <figcaption class="an-mono">Après · 34,5 heures plus tard</figcaption>
          </div>
        </figure>
        <p class="an-mono an-ticket-foot">Approuvé par M.L. · essai routier réussi · facture n° INV-2481</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- THE LOG: chronological ledger of jobs -->
    <section class="an-wrap an-logsec" id="log" aria-labelledby="log-title">
      <div class="an-sec-head">
        <h2 class="an-h2" id="log-title">Le journal de baie</h2>
        <p class="an-log-sub">Chaque travail approuvé entre dans le registre. Noms tenus confidentiels, voitures et chiffres sont réels.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="an-ledger" role="table" aria-label="Travaux récents">
        <div class="an-row an-row-head" role="row" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="an-mono">Date</span><span class="an-mono">N° bon</span><span class="an-mono">Véhicule</span><span class="an-mono">Travail</span><span class="an-mono">Tech</span><span class="an-mono">Total</span>
        </div>
        <a class="an-row" role="row" href="#order">
          <span class="an-mono an-date">2 oct.</span><span class="an-mono an-wo">#2480</span>
          <span class="an-veh"><img src={IMG.engine} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />Audi RS6 Avant</span>
          <span class="an-work">Diagnostic complet, ratés intermittents. Bobines 2 et 5 remplacées, essai routier concluant.</span>
          <span class="an-mono an-tech">J.R.</span><span class="an-mono an-total">$1,240</span>
        </a>
        <a class="an-row" role="row" href="#order">
          <span class="an-mono an-date">1er oct.</span><span class="an-mono an-wo">#2479</span>
          <span class="an-veh"><img src={IMG.garage} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />BMW M4 Competition</span>
          <span class="an-work">Inspection préachat, 140 points. Deux raccords de peinture détectés, l'acheteur est reparti informé.</span>
          <span class="an-mono an-tech">M.L.</span><span class="an-mono an-total">$380</span>
        </a>
        <a class="an-row" role="row" href="#order">
          <span class="an-mono an-date">30 sept.</span><span class="an-mono an-wo">#2478</span>
          <span class="an-veh"><img src={IMG.detail} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />Mercedes-AMG GT</span>
          <span class="an-work">Remise à neuf de l'intérieur, décontamination et scellant. Volant en Alcantara ramené à la vie.</span>
          <span class="an-mono an-tech">J.R.</span><span class="an-mono an-total">$1,650</span>
        </a>
        <a class="an-row" role="row" href="#order">
          <span class="an-mono an-date">27 sept.</span><span class="an-mono an-wo">#2477</span>
          <span class="an-veh"><img src={IMG.hero} alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" />Tesla Model 3</span>
          <span class="an-work">Alignement performance, service des freins, filtre d'habitacle. Entrée et sortie le même jour.</span>
          <span class="an-mono an-tech">M.L.</span><span class="an-mono an-total">$520</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="an-mono an-log-foot">Les anciennes entrées vivent dans le cartable de l'atelier. Demandez à le feuilleter lors de votre visite.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- RATE CARD: pinned shop price board -->
    <section class="an-ratesec" id="rates" aria-labelledby="rates-title">
      <div class="an-wrap">
        <div class="an-board" role="region" aria-label="Carte des tarifs de l'atelier">
          <span class="an-pin an-pin-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="an-pin an-pin-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div class="an-board-head">
            <h2 class="an-h2 an-h2-board" id="rates-title">Carte des tarifs</h2>
            <p class="an-mono an-board-note">Épinglée au mur de l'atelier depuis 2019 · prix avant taxes</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="an-board-list">
            <li><span>Inspection préachat 140 points</span><span class="an-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="an-mono">$380 forfaitaire</span></li>
            <li><span>Polissage machine 1 étape</span><span class="an-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="an-mono">à partir de $650</span></li>
            <li><span>Polissage 2 étapes + céramique 5 ans</span><span class="an-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="an-mono">à partir de $2,900</span></li>
            <li><span>Remise à neuf de l'intérieur</span><span class="an-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="an-mono">à partir de $390</span></li>
            <li><span>Décontamination + scellant</span><span class="an-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="an-mono">à partir de $480</span></li>
            <li><span>Alignement performance</span><span class="an-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="an-mono">à partir de $220</span></li>
            <li><span>Diagnostic électrique, à l'heure</span><span class="an-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="an-mono">$140 / h</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="an-board-foot">Soumission fixe avant qu'on touche à la voiture. Si on trouve autre chose, on appelle avant de réparer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FILE A WORK ORDER -->
    <section class="an-wrap an-ordersec" id="order" aria-labelledby="order-title">
      <div class="an-order-grid">
        <div>
          <h2 class="an-h2" id="order-title">Déposer un bon de travail</h2>
          <p class="an-order-sub">Dites-nous la voiture et le problème. On vous répond dans un jour ouvrable avec un rendez-vous et une soumission fixe.</p>
          <p class="an-mono an-order-hours">Mar. à sam. · 8 h à 18 h · 2150, boul. Lapinière, Brossard</p>
        </div>
        <form class="an-form" id="order-form">
          <label>Votre nom<input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" /></label>
          <div class="an-form-2col">
            <label>Véhicule<input type="text" name="vehicle" placeholder="p. ex. GR86 2022" required /></label>
            <label>Plaque<input type="text" name="plate" placeholder="ABC 123" /></label>
          </div>
          <label>Service requis
            <select name="service">
              <option>Diagnostic</option>
              <option>Polissage 1 étape</option>
              <option>Polissage 2 étapes + céramique</option>
              <option>Remise à neuf de l'intérieur</option>
              <option>Inspection préachat</option>
              <option>Autre chose</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>Que fait-elle (ou ne fait-elle pas)?<textarea name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Décrivez le problème dans vos mots"></textarea></label>
          <button class="an-btn an-btn-amber an-btn-full" type="submit">Envoyer le bon de travail</button>
          <p class="an-mono an-form-done" id="form-done" hidden>Reçu. On vous rappellera avec un rendez-vous et une soumission fixe.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="an-foot">
    <div class="an-wrap an-foot-in">
      <p class="an-mono">Atelier Nord · Brossard QC · site de démonstration fictif</p>
      <p class="an-mono">(450) 555-0147 · bonjour@ateliernord.example</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <EscapeHatch locale="fr" />

  <style>
    .an { --bg: #12100c; --bg2: #1a1712; --paper: #f4efe3; --paper-dim: #d9d2bd; --ink: #ece7d8; --mut: #a39c86; --amber: #f2a71b; --amber-d: #c77f0a; --red: #d9483b; --line: #2c2820; --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, monospace; --sans: "Space Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; }
    .an * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    .an img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
    .an .an-wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
    .an .an-mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    .an .an-h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 62px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 18px 0 0; font-weight: 700; }
    .an .an-h1-sub { display: block; font-size: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 22px); font-weight: 500; color: var(--amber); letter-spacing: 0; margin-top: 10px; }
    .an .an-h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; line-height: 1.05; }
    .an .an-btn { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; padding: 13px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
    .an .an-btn-sm { padding: 9px 15px; font-size: 13px; }
    .an .an-btn-full { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
    .an .an-btn-amber { background: var(--amber); color: #171204; }
    .an .an-btn-amber:hover { background: #ffba3a; }

    /* slim header */
    .an-top { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; background: rgba(18,16,12,.94); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .an-top-in { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; }
    .an-logo { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); margin-right: auto; }
    .an-logo-mark { font-weight: 700; color: var(--amber); font-size: 18px; }
    .an-logo-text { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 14px; }
    .an-logo-sub { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--mut); }
    .an-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
    .an-links a { color: var(--mut); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
    .an-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    /* ticket: torn work order */
    .an-ticket { margin-top: 34px; }
    .an-ticket-perf { height: 14px; background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 8px 50%, var(--bg) 6px, transparent 6.5px); background-size: 24px 14px; background-repeat: repeat-x; }
    .an-ticket-body { background: var(--paper); color: #201b12; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 44px); position: relative; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45); }
    .an-ticket-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .an-ticket-kicker { color: #6d6350; margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .an-stamp { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red); border: 3px double var(--red); border-radius: 6px; padding: 7px 14px; transform: rotate(-4deg); margin: 0; }
    .an-ticket-body .an-h1 { color: #171204; }
    .an-ticket-meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin: 26px 0 0; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 2px solid #201b12; border-bottom: 2px solid #201b12; }
    .an-ticket-meta div { margin: 0; }
    .an-ticket-meta dt { color: #6d6350; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .an-ticket-meta dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; }
    .an-ticket-note { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3d362a; max-width: 62ch; }
    .an-beforeafter { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin: 24px 0 0; }
    .an-ba img { width: 100%; height: 240px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px; }
    .an-ba figcaption { margin-top: 8px; color: #6d6350; }
    .an-ticket-foot { color: #6d6350; margin: 22px 0 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px dashed #b9ae93; }

    /* ledger */
    .an-logsec { margin-top: 72px; }
    .an-sec-head { margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .an-log-sub { color: var(--mut); margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 15px; }
    .an-ledger { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .an-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px 70px 1.1fr 1.6fr 60px 80px; gap: 14px; align-items: center; padding: 16px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); }
    a.an-row:hover { background: var(--bg2); }
    .an-row-head { color: var(--mut); text-transform: uppercase; padding: 10px 6px; }
    .an-row-head span { font-size: 11px; }
    .an-date { color: var(--amber); }
    .an-wo { color: var(--mut); }
    .an-veh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
    .an-veh img { width: 52px; height: 40px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 5px; }
    .an-work { color: var(--mut); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .an-total { font-weight: 600; text-align: right; }
    .an-log-foot { color: var(--mut); margin-top: 16px; }

    /* rate board */
    .an-ratesec { margin-top: 72px; }
    .an-board { position: relative; background: #20241f; border: 10px solid #3a2f22; border-radius: 6px; padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 44px); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
    .an-pin { position: absolute; top: -14px; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #ff8a8a, var(--red) 60%, #8f1f14); box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
    .an-pin-1 { left: 8%; } .an-pin-2 { right: 8%; }
    .an-board-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .an-h2-board { color: #f5ecd7; font-family: var(--mono); letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px); }
    .an-board-note { color: #b9ac8c; margin: 0; }
    .an-board-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .an-board-list li { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed #4a4232; color: #efe6cd; font-size: 16px; }
    .an-board-list li .an-dots { flex: 1; border-bottom: 2px dotted #6b5f45; transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .an-board-list li .an-mono { color: var(--amber); font-size: 14px; white-space: nowrap; }
    .an-board-foot { color: #b9ac8c; font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0 0; font-style: italic; }

    /* order form */
    .an-ordersec { margin: 72px auto 90px; }
    .an-order-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: start; }
    .an-order-sub { color: var(--mut); line-height: 1.6; }
    .an-order-hours { color: var(--amber); margin-top: 18px; }
    .an-form { display: grid; gap: 14px; background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 26px; }
    .an-form label { display: grid; gap: 7px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--paper-dim); }
    .an-form-2col { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    .an-form input, .an-form select, .an-form textarea { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 15px; padding: 11px 12px; border-radius: 7px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); width: 100%; }
    .an-form input:focus, .an-form select:focus, .an-form textarea:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 1px; }
    .an-form-done { color: var(--amber); margin: 4px 0 0; }

    .an-foot { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 22px 0 60px; }
    .an-foot-in { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .an-foot p { color: var(--mut); margin: 0; }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .an-links { display: none; }
      .an-ticket-meta { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .an-beforeafter { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .an-ba img { height: 200px; }
      .an-row { grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr 74px; grid-template-areas: "date veh total" "work work work" "wo tech tech"; row-gap: 6px; }
      .an-row-head { display: none; }
      .an-date { grid-area: date; } .an-wo { grid-area: wo; } .an-veh { grid-area: veh; }
      .an-work { grid-area: work; } .an-tech { grid-area: tech; } .an-total { grid-area: total; }
      .an-order-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .an * { transition: none !important; }
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    (function () {
      var form = document.getElementById('order-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
      var done = document.getElementById('form-done');
      form?.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        if (done) done.hidden = false;
        form?.reset();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
